==Behind the scenes==
The Academy for Young Imperials first appeared as the Imperial Academy in the ''[[Star Wars Rebels]]'' episode ''[[Breaking Ranks]]'', which premiered on [[October 27]], [[2014]]. Its backstory was further explored in [[Jason Fry]]'s [[Star Wars Rebels: Servants of the Empire|''Servants of the Empire'']] young adult novel series, which ran from October 2014 to October 2015.

